あい わな joy と joy と joy と youきなベイベー
I wanna Joy! To Joy! To Joy! With a cheerful baby,

122
00:18:41,037 --> 00:18:46,437
Joy と joy と joy と happyな say イェー
Joy! To Joy! To Joy! And a happy say yeah!

123
00:18:47,137 --> 00:18:49,937
君の心はそう もっと do do
Your heart beats even more, do do!

124
00:18:50,037 --> 00:18:52,737
僕の心もそう いっそ good good
My heart too, might as well go good good!

125
00:18:53,037 --> 00:18:55,937
はじけてるんじゃない？ イッツ ジョイふる
Isn't it about to burst? It's joyful!

126
00:18:59,237 --> 00:19:04,537
Joy と joy と joy と popなベイベー
I wanna Joy! To Joy! To Joy! With a pop baby,

127
