This is also a T-shirt featuring the key visual! It's an illustration drawn by Izumi papa, and it's no exaggeration to say it was drawn to make this cool T-shirt. He finished it in a somewhat rock-ish style, so yes! Since it's cool, how about everyone wearing it in daily life!

