Well, since it's a sacoche, um, it's good for putting wallets, smartphones, etc. in, but well, since the outer pocket is transparent, you can put pin badges in it, make it a bit of an ita-bag, or put some merch in to appeal—it's a bag made so you can do all that!

303
00:37:30,176 --> 00:37:43,176
はい！まあ本当にね、なんかこうちょっと、ま、荷物用で一袋持って、え、お財布とか取り出しやすいようにこのサコッシュを1個持ってると、使いやすいかなと思って作りました。
Yes! Well, really, you know, just holding one bag for luggage, um, having one of this sacoche so wallets are easy to take out, I made it thinking it would be easy to use.

