[Title: Ame Sansan]

368
00:49:50,222 --> 00:49:59,572
選べよ 変わりゆく時代を 割り切れなくとも
Choose the changing era, even if you can't fully make sense of it...

369
00:50:00,160 --> 00:50:04,280
この瞬間 この舞台を 生き抜くから
Surviving this very moment, this very stage...

370
00:50:05,180 --> 00:50:10,280
手答えの無い 今日でさえも
Even on a day that gives no feedback...

371
00:50:11,130 --> 00:50:16,180
紡ぐよ でこぼこな 此の道に
I'll weave ahead along this bumpy road

372
00:50:17,080 --> 00:50:20,180
降り注ぐ 雨燦々と
As the rain pours down brilliantly

373
00:50:21,080 --> 00:50:24,080
雨燦々と 悩ましく 生き惑う
The rain pours down brilliantly, wandering through life in distress

374
00:50:24,180 --> 00:50:29,580
僕らの 悲しみさえも 水に流してゆく
Washing away even our sorrows with the water

375
00:50:30,180 --> 00:50:36,280
錆びついた 自転車を 走らせて君へと向かうのさ
Riding a rusted bicycle, heading towards you—

376
00:50:37,080 --> 00:50:43,580
雨に濡れながら帰ろう
Let's head home getting soaked in the rain.

377
00:50:52,080 --> 00:51:01,080
臨時ニュースの報せでは どうやらこれから土砂降りの雨が降るらしい
According to breaking news reports, it looks like a heavy downpour is on the way

378
00:51:02,080 --> 00:51:06,080
傘を忘れた 溜息は
A sigh for the forgotten umbrella...

379
00:51:06,580 --> 00:51:11,880
夕立ちが連れてきた夏の匂いに解けてゆく
Melts away into the scent of summer brought by the evening shower

380
00:51:12,580 --> 00:51:18,580
過去を謳う悲しみ達が 雲となり雨を打ちつける
Sorrows singing of the past turn into clouds and beat down as rain

381
00:51:22,080 --> 00:51:29,080
叫べよ 気の晴れるまで 声は雨に掻き消され
Shout until the sky clears, though our voices are drowned out by the rain

382
00:51:30,080 --> 00:51:35,580
今じゃ何処の誰にも 届かなくても
Even if it doesn't reach anyone anywhere now...

383
00:51:36,080 --> 00:51:45,080
手遅れになってしまった未来へさえも 繋ぐよ そのバトンを
Even towards a future that's already too late, we pass on that baton

384
00:51:46,080 --> 00:51:50,080
静かに 待ってる人がいる
Someone is quietly waiting

385
00:51:50,580 --> 00:51:53,980
雨燦々と 悩ましく
The rain pours down brilliantly, distressingly

386
00:51:54,080 --> 00:52:00,080
生き惑う 僕らの 悲しみさえも 水に流してゆく
Wandering through life, washing away even our sorrows with the water

387
00:52:01,080 --> 00:52:07,580
線路沿い 風を切り 一直線に君へと向かうのさ
Cutting through the wind along the railway, heading straight towards you—

388
00:52:08,080 --> 00:52:14,580
雨に濡れながら帰ろう
Let's head home getting soaked in the rain.

389
00:52:18,080 --> 00:52:30,080
みおちゃ、お誕生日おめでとう！
Mio-chan, happy birthday!

390
00:52:32,080 --> 00:52:37,080
みんな誕生日をお祝いしてくれてありがとう！
Thank you everyone for celebrating my birthday!

391
00:52:38,080 --> 00:52:43,080
雨燦々と降り注ぎ
The rain pours down brilliantly...

392
00:52:44,080 --> 00:52:51,080
夏を泳いでずぶ濡れの
Swimming through summer, soaked to the bone...

393
00:52:52,080 --> 00:52:57,080
僕らを映し出す
Reflecting us...

394
00:52:58,080 --> 00:53:07,080
烈しく照りつける 太陽よ 僕らを導いておくれよ
Fierce blazing sun, lead us onward

395
00:53:08,080 --> 00:53:17,080
未来を謳う言葉だけが 風となり森を吹き抜ける
Only words singing of the future become the wind and blow through the forest

396
00:53:23,080 --> 00:53:30,080
選べよ 変わりゆく時代を 割り切れなくとも
Choose the changing era, even if you can't make sense of it

397
00:53:32,080 --> 00:53:36,580
この瞬間 この舞台を 生き抜くから
Surviving this very moment, this very stage...

398
00:53:38,080 --> 00:53:42,580
青き春の 瞬きから 何度醒めようとも
From the twinkling of youth, no matter how many times we awaken from it...

399
00:53:43,080 --> 00:53:48,580
紡ぐよ でこぼこな 此の道に
We weave ahead along this bumpy road

400
00:53:49,080 --> 00:53:54,580
降り注ぐ 雨燦々と 悩ましく
As the rain pours down brilliantly, distressingly

401
00:53:55,080 --> 00:54:02,080
生き惑う 僕らの 悲しみさえも 水に流してゆく
Wandering through life, washing away even our sorrows with the water

402
00:54:03,080 --> 00:54:09,080
錆びついた 自転車を 走らせて君へと向かうのさ
Riding a rusted bicycle, heading towards you—

403
00:54:10,080 --> 00:54:15,580
雨に濡れながら帰ろう
Let's head home getting soaked in the rain.

404
00:54:18,080 --> 00:54:33,080
みんな誕生日をお祝いしてくれて ありがとう！
Thank you everyone for celebrating my birthday!

405
